# Surface Pro 12 (Intel): the Flex Keyboard's touchpad over Bluetooth is the
# same touchpad as when attached. systemd assumes Bluetooth touchpads are
# external, and libinput then drops palm detection; mark it internal.
# 60-sp12-flex-keyboard.quirks keeps it from being suspended in tablet mode.
touchpad:bluetooth:v045ep0c7a:*
 ID_INPUT_TOUCHPAD_INTEGRATION=internal
